desc:
1 Bed + Large Den (2 Bed) | EV* Parking + Storage

Beautiful corner unit condo in the heart of Lower Lonsdale (LoLo) – with excellent natural light, offering comfort, flexibility, and unbeatable walkability.

* Large den (7ft x 7ft) with window, can be 2nd bedroom / home office - fits twin bed and small furniture;
* Large bedroom can fit king size bed and nightstands;
* Large kitchen, with dishwasher and plenty of storage;
* Heated floors throughout for added comfort;
* Living room nook desk – ideal for home office or study area;
* Optional Level 2 EV charging;
* In unit laundry;
* Open, functional layout, large windows throughout.

🚗 Included:
* 1 secured parking stall - EV optional
* 1 storage locker
* Access to 2 bike rooms – perfect for active lifestyles

📍 Prime Location:
* Steps to SeaBus – quick commute to Downtown Vancouver;
* Short walk to Shipyards District (restaurants, cafés, waterfront, events);
* Close to groceries, shops, gyms, and daily essentials.

💡 Ideal For:

* Professionals or responsible tenants seeking a convenient location and a well-maintained home
